  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: Now, before you head out, I just wanted to make sure that you have
      all the essentials.
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5192d2ae68c371d4c88ca9a5e91ea005, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: "If not, don\u2019t worry, I put together an emergency kit for you."
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5192d2ae68c371d4c88ca9a5e91ea005, type: 3}
  - Dialogue: "Had to dip into my own reserves for this, so don\u2019t use anything
      unless you need to."
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5192d2ae68c371d4c88ca9a5e91ea005, type: 3}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Hey, always be prepared for the worst, remember?
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CombinedDialogue:
    - Dialogue: "Oh, there\u2019s no need to worry. It has nothing to do you with
        you."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    - Dialogue: My, where has the time gone...
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5192d2ae68c371d4c88ca9a5e91ea005, type: 3}
    - Dialogue: Who knew that my little Pumpkin could grow so tall?
      Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5192d2ae68c371d4c88ca9a5e91ea005, type: 3}
    PlayerDialogue: "I didn\u2019t realize I was supposed to be preparing for a survival
      show."
